Yes, given the quantity of different commands, not knowing them all is the  
curse of the beginners. And some of them are much more useful that what  
one can thing at first. But once you know how to find secret doors, the  
rest you'll probably be able to figure out by yourself (don't forget to  
read the help on commands from time to time and wonder what use there can  
be for the ones you still haven't used...)

Oh, and in Nethack you usually learns things the hard way. Once dead, you  
know that what you did was a bad idea...
If you're not afraid of spoilers, don't hesitate to read some of them  
(google "nethack spoiler" should lead to pages with too much info for you  
to handle right now, but with time and many games it should become very  
useful). Or ask questions here (specify if you don't want to be spoiled as  
several people will consider that by coming here you accept being spoiled).

